## Structure

```
src/
├── {{pascalCase projectName}}.Api/            ← Controllers, Middleware
├── {{pascalCase projectName}}.Application/    ← Services, Interfaces, DTOs
├── {{pascalCase projectName}}.Domain/         ← Entities, Repository Interfaces (core)
└── {{pascalCase projectName}}.Infrastructure/ ← Repository implementations, DbContext
```

All dependencies point inward toward the Domain layer.

